The world export in corpus/acl2/x86-run and its generated Lean terms are
derived from ACL2 8.7, books/projects/x86isa/machine/x86.lisp, at
https://github.com/acl2/acl2/blob/bc6f4f49e81a0711214a8d91f0d06e0e084d2204/books/projects/x86isa/machine/x86.lisp.

The status and environment exports in corpus/acl2/x86-status and
corpus/acl2/x86-environment and their generated Lean terms also derive
from the same release's machine/state.lisp.
https://github.com/acl2/acl2/blob/bc6f4f49e81a0711214a8d91f0d06e0e084d2204/books/projects/x86isa/machine/state.lisp

The object-order export in corpus/acl2/x86-order and its generated Lean
terms also derive from that release's axioms.lisp, books/misc/total-order.lisp,
and books/projects/x86isa/machine/tty.lisp.
The environment and TLB exports also contain definitions from axioms.lisp.
The TLB export in corpus/acl2/x86-tlb derives from that release's
machine/tlb.lisp and books/ihs/basic-definitions.lisp.
